		{
			dependencies: ["103203350DABF6BB"]
			description: [
				"&eRecommended Level: 50"
				""
				"&7The raw essence of the end; the \"Ender Eye\", has been corrupted by the void's presence, turned into a horrific creature. It now needs to be saved from the void's influence to establish balance in the now desolated dimension."
				""
				"&7The Eye can only be summoned at an Eye Shrine. The Shrine is built with a base of a 5×5 obsidian platform and a 3×3 centered crying obsidian layer. On all four corners an end rod has to get placed. On top of the shrine you shall sacrifice the dragon egg. The Eye can only get called in The end dimension."
				""
				"{image:a_overrides:textures/quests/indication/eye_shrine.png width:200 height:120 align:1}"
				""
				"&8English"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eNivel Recomendado: 50"
				""
				"&7La esencia pura del End; el \"Ojo del Ender\", ha sido corrompida por la presencia del vacío y transformada en una criatura horrorosa. Ahora debe ser salvado de esa maligna influencia para restablecer el equilibrio en la ahora desolada dimensión."
				""
				"&7El Ojo solo puede ser invocado en un Santuario del Ojo. El Santuario se construye sobre una plataforma de obsidiana de 5x5 y una capa central de obsidiana llorosa de 3x3. En cada uno de los cuatro bordes se debe colocar una vara del end. En la cima del santuario, deberás tú sacrificar el huevo de dragón. El Ojo solo puede ser invocado en la dimensión del End."
				""
				"{image:a_overrides:textures/quests/indication/eye_shrine.png width:200 height:120 align:1}"
				""
				"&8Español"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "a_overrides:textures/quests/icon/the_eldritch_eye.png"
				}
			}
			id: "0E567E587E669BED"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "5E60883C821CB3E5"
					item: "prominent:cinderstone_trophy"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "73120B643C6ABF1C"
					item: "prominent:infused_molten_remnant"
					type: "item"
				}
