				"&o&7\"Flameborn, I wish you the best of luck in your journey to this unknown land."
				""
				"&o&7I shall inform you of anything new through this book, remember to also read other guides and information written by the previous flameborn."
				""
				"&o&7Do not seek them immediately, make sure you are well prepared enough, we don't know  their strength."
