			description: [
				"&7With the defeat of the The Eye, the end has been affected by the void's higher forces, &dthe cosmic horrors&7. Eldritch beings that hold pure corruption in their veins."
				""
				"&8English"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&7Con la derrota de El Ojo, el End ha sido afectado por las fuerzas superiores del vacío, &dlos horrores cósmicos&7. Seres ancestrales que llevan corrupción pura en sus venas."
