			description: [
				"&eThe Aberrations.&7 They are horrific creatures that live in the Primordial Abyss. Be careful with them, when they hit you, they will apply &9corruption&7 to you, which is stackable. You don't want them to hit you multiple times."
				""
				"&8English"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eLas Aberraciones.&7 Son criaturas horribles que habitan en el Abismo Primordial. Ten cuidado con ellas, cuando te golpean, te aplican &9corrupción&7, la cual es acumulable. No querrás que te golpeen varias veces."
				""
				"&8Español"
			]
