			description: [
				"&6\"It is waiting for you. Bring that pedestal to the end and place two of the end's essence, an ender pearl and a end crystal. Be prepared, and don't forget to trap it. You have my blessing, child.\" &e&oS'kellak said"
				""
				"&8English"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6\"Te está esperando. Lleva ese pedestal al End y coloca dos esencias del End, una perla de ender y un cristal del End. Prepárate, y no olvides atraparlo. Tienes mi bendición, mi joven.\" &e&oDijo S'kellak."
