		{
			dependencies: ["3A8C4B633BAF1EFF"]
			description: [
				"&6\"To summon the last herald, you'll have to go through their own dark magic. You should make a weapon born of true corruption, The Dreadtide, to get yourself mad to attract the dark thoughts from the void, the All-Seeing Eyes; we'll need 4 of them for the ritual."
				""
				"&6While you do this, I'll find more knowledge on the ritual. Just beware, don't fall into madness, as there's no going back.\" &e&oS'kellak said"
				""
				"[ \"Currently you need to kill Aberrations via \", { \"text\": \"this quest\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"734EDDD8FFBE8BC9\" } }, \" to progress.\" ]"
				""
				"&8English"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6\"Para invocar al último heraldo, tendrás que utilizar su propia magia oscura. Deberías forjar un arma nacida de la verdadera corrupción, la Dreadtide, para enloquecer y atraer los pensamientos más oscuros del vacío, los Ojos Omniscientes; necesitaremos 4 de ellos para el ritual."
				""
				"&6Mientras haces esto, buscaré más conocimiento sobre el ritual. Solo ten cuidado, no caigas en la locura, ya que no hay vuelta atrás.\" &e&oDijo S'kellak."
				""
				"&8Español"
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: "eldritch_end:ominous_eye"
			id: "0A5F7ABD54251511"
			rewards: [{
				id: "50729E9131DFED4A"
				item: "prominent:molten_remnant"
				type: "item"
