			dependencies: ["69574BA63A9F05E8"]
			description: [
				"&7The Faceless One has been captured and trapped inside Vaaz, S'kellak interrogated it."
				""
				"&9\"C' mgepmgah, llll h', c'den ephaiagl ot e'enhe, ymg' ahorna mgah ahf''s nog, ymg' ahorna mgah uh'eog ph'nglui turor\" &e&oThe Faceless said, in an unknown tongue"
				""
				"&6\"My child, if what it says is true, then our war has just started.\" &e&oSaid S'kellak, worried."
				""
				"&8&oDeep within the end, the rift closes, and a dark portal opens."
				""
				"&8English"
