				"&eRecommended Level: 10"
				"&cBetter suitable for Melee."
				""
				"&7Found in the Nether, he was cursed by what he thought was his allies. His kingdom was sieged and fell under the lava sea, and the King could only watch helplessly while his mind and body was slowly withering away."
